  "evidencia": "Page: Sinclair Research. Sentence: Sinclair Research Ltd is a British consumer electronics company founded by Clive Sinclair in Cambridge.\nPage: Sinclair Research. Sentence: It was originally incorporated in 1973 as Westminster Mail Order Ltd, renamed Sinclair Instrument Ltd, then Science of Cambridge Ltd, then Sinclair Computers Ltd, and finally Sinclair Research Ltd in 1975.\nPage: Wave Mate Bullet. Sentence: The Wave Mate Bullet was a Z80 single-board computer from the late 1970s and early 1980s which used the CP/M operating system.\nPage: Science Horizons Survival. Sentence: It was published by Sinclair Research in association with Macmillan Education in 1984.",
