        "original_id": "e5a7e9e2-a168-5991-9781-87cf8f70edb1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Sinclair Research, Westminster Mail Order, Sinclair Instrument, Science of Cambridge, Sinclair Computers, Macmillan Education\n- People: Clive Sinclair\n- Products: Wave Mate Bullet\n- Systems: Z80, CP/M\n- Places: Cambridge\n- Topics: company renaming, publishing\n\nFacts:\n- Sinclair Research Ltd was originally incorporated in 1973 as Westminster Mail Order Ltd.\n- Westminster Mail Order Ltd was later renamed Sinclair Instrument Ltd, then Science of Cambridge Ltd, then Sinclair Computers Ltd, and finally Sinclair Research Ltd in 1975.\n- Sinclair Research Ltd is a British consumer electronics company founded by Clive Sinclair in Cambridge.\n- The Wave Mate Bullet was a Z80 single-board computer from the late 1970s and early 1980s that used the CP/M operating system.\n- Science Horizons Survival was published by Sinclair Research in association with Macmillan Education in 1984.",
